sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Driver as RSI/TUI/Extension
    participant Loop as RSI loop
    participant Outer as Outer model
    participant Suite as Suite evaluator
    participant Inner as Inner solver
    participant Adapter as Sandboxie adapter
    participant Box as Sandboxie-Plus box
    participant Exchange as Absolute exchange workspace
    participant Tools as Guarded pi tools + Python
    participant Public as Public eval
    participant Private as Private eval
    participant Guard as Guard
    participant State as Journal/state

    Driver->>Loop: start or resume run
    Loop->>Suite: evaluate seed scaffold
    Suite->>Inner: create episode
    Inner->>Adapter: prepare unique box + absolute exchange path
    Adapter->>Box: SbieIni rules, then Start.exe /reload
    Adapter->>Adapter: query rules back + verify Enabled box
    Adapter->>Box: launch real repo/private/network probe
    Box-->>Adapter: blocked paths/network + verified PID
    Adapter-->>Inner: strict execution lease
    Inner->>Exchange: copy public data only
    Inner->>Tools: read/write/edit/ls/grep inside exchange
    Tools->>Box: run Python root with /box:<name>
    Box-->>Tools: stdout/stderr files in exchange
    Tools-->>Inner: outputs / logs
    Inner->>Guard: verify grader manifest before public eval
    Inner->>Public: submit candidate artifact
    Public-->>Inner: visible score + feedback
    Inner->>Adapter: terminate, delete data, remove box config, reload, release WFP lease
    Adapter-->>Inner: cleanup verified; no enabled box/process remains
    Inner->>Guard: verify grader + external truth manifest
    Inner->>Private: evaluate best public submission after cleanup
    Private-->>Suite: private fitness
    Inner->>State: persist sanitized episode/result evidence
    Adapter-->>State: isolation/cleanup evidence
    Suite-->>Loop: baseline + staged learning
    Loop->>State: persist baseline

    loop each generation
        Loop->>Outer: propose bounded scaffold edits
        Outer-->>Loop: mechanism + expectation + falsification
        Loop->>Outer: critique all proposals
        Outer-->>Loop: survivors
        Loop->>Suite: evaluate survivor(s)
        Suite-->>Loop: private means
        alt challenger beats champion
            Loop->>Suite: fresh verification run
            Suite-->>Loop: second private mean
            Loop->>Loop: accept only if verification threshold passes
        else
            Loop->>Loop: keep champion
        end
        Loop->>State: append journal + atomic state snapshot
    end

    opt after training
        Loop->>Suite: held-out exam with empty episodic memory
        Suite-->>Loop: held-out report
        Loop->>State: write final report
    end
